Instrumentation-only: remove the static state left by patch 0001.

Patch 0001 stopped trace files from being created, but its null-stream fallback
still instantiated the stream, header flag and counters as function-local
statics.  The feeder's DBG_COUT-only counters were also still compiled when
SAURIA_DEBUG=0.  Those objects are shared by every instance of a template and
violate TPU_V3's no-mutable-static-state contract even when they affect only
diagnostics.

This follow-up puts complete trace blocks behind SAURIA_TRACE_FILES and complete
DBG_COUT blocks behind SAURIA_DEBUG.  Both switches are forced to zero by the
TPU_V3 target.  No arithmetic, address generation, handshake or wait changes.

